  "description": "The current pause in HS2 has created ongoing uncertainty around the long-term future of the blocks. In light of this, maintaining safety remains a top priority.\nExtending the planning application for a further five years will allow the meanwhile spaces operator to continue their valuable presence across the blocks. This not only supports Camden’s thriving artistic community but also contributes to significant savings for the Council—particularly by reducing void-related costs.\nIn addition, this extension aligns closely with the \"We Make Camden\" vision. Bow Arts has played a key role in strengthening Camden’s vibrant economy by actively employing local residents and nurturing creative growth\n",
